      "id": "spin-selling-s039-p00349",
      "source_en": "A major-account seller from Xerox once told me that he tried out the exercise with a friend, using a new car as the topic. A week later she actually bought a new car, explaining to him, \"Your questions really convinced me I should.\" The power of Need-payoff Questions is of ten visible in these simple practice demonstrations. Watch for it.",
